        "ggP7sDzQPCu_text": "<p>We build scalable, secure, and conversion-focused eCommerce solutions tailored to your business needs—whether you're starting from scratch or enhancing your existing store.</p>",
        "ggQa5eOOm8q_text": "Our Services / What We Offer",
        "ggayb-Fb0ws_text": "<p>Craft visually stunning, fast, and user-friendly websites tailored to your brand and business goals. From concept to launch, we build responsive, SEO-optimized websites that convert visitors into customers.</p>",
