    "gp_section_573957390081197104": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "bdd8929af49daf3fb7f13763a45d303ae35d9975c268bc12770fe8f468d39753_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg-4B2rUAmP_text": "<p>Great team, smooth process, supportive and on-time delivery.</p>",
        "gg0DVi2XJJr_text": "What Our Clients Are Saying",
        "gg58Ap20l9x_text": "<p>We needed a quick addition to the homepage of our site which is running a highly customized template. RootSyntax was prompt, their services complete and at a good value. We will definitely contact in the future.</p>",
        "gg90wU02Izs_text": "<p>- Sonoran Gold Honey</p>",
        "gg9_KwkiHMg_text": "<p>RootSyntax Technologies was a pleasure to work with and help me to accomplish all that I wanted with my website! Audrey was qucik to reply to my questions and my website received all of the upgrades I had wanted.</p>",
        "gg9kwx7ftdp_text": "<p>- Table Wraps</p>",
        "ggBN2DX9aVp_text": "<p>Pleasant experience, responsive team, all upgrades delivered.</p>",
        "ggC5Hgfd1xU_text": "<p>- Rare Aviation</p>",
        "ggHLnHhtSCH_text": "<p>- 3 Monkeys Publishing</p>",
        "ggLIaxc4fkc_text": "<p>Work well for my problem feet</p>",
        "ggO2vmUf6Cs_text": "<p>Quick, valuable service on customized homepage update.</p>",
        "ggOkMOswdD1_text": "<p>- Rare Aviation</p>",
        "ggOuQqzrTFO_text": "<p>Our customer advocates are standing by 24/7 to support you via email.</p>",
        "ggQrPGyPoL-_text": "<p>- Table Wraps</p>",
        "ggShp3wthVA_text": "<p>- Pine House</p>",
        "gg_XBjbzpd-_text": "<p>Awesome job. Will hire again. Great communications. It was delivered as promised. The best part was they did not require micromanaging. Just got on with the work and finished the project on time and budget.</p>",
        "ggb5PWkGiNI_text": "<p>- Kiryosity</p>",
        "ggcHMiami19_text": "<p>We couldn’t be happier with the incredible work done by our Shopify partner who revamped our website! &nbsp;Their expertise, creativity, and attention to detail have completely transformed our online store into a modern, user-friendly, and visually stunning platform. From seamless navigation to sleek design elements, every aspect of the site reflects their deep understanding of e-commerce and our brand vision.</p>",
        "ggdEz11IsG8_text": "<p>Expert revamp delivered stunning, user-friendly Shopify store.</p>",
        "gggVfz4fWxP_text": "<p>My experience in putting together a website was zero. &nbsp;Rootsyntax listened to my needs and delivered. &nbsp;I love my website! &nbsp;The instructional videos on how to make changes have been very helpful with a slight challenge on language barrier.</p>",
        "ggkI8qE1MAs_text": "<p>Audrey and her team did an amazing &nbsp;job. They were very easy to work with and to communicate with. &nbsp;They really listened to me when creating my website. My project was completed on time, and I was left with the tools and support I need to makesure my project runs smoothly in the future. Rootsyntax is worth the price.</p>",
        "ggoXzed3swj_text": "<p>Great work, timely delivery, no micromanagement needed.</p>",
        "ggoeJvhZY4-_text": "<p>Awesome job. Will hire again. Great communications. It was delivered as promised. The best part was they did not require micromanaging. Just got on with the work and finished the project on time and budget.</p>",
        "ggqs-PMFmXN_text": "<p>You're walking on a cloud!</p>",
        "ggvyj7kQsGM_text": "<p>Rootsyntax delivered helpful, loved website.</p>",
        "ggyFpTNYy_V_text": "<p>We needed a quick addition to the homepage of our site which is running a highly customized template. RootSyntax was prompt, their services complete and at a good value. We will definitely contact in the future.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-573957390081197104"
    },
