      "settings": {
        "checksum": "b4ecd5aa57642722c162e89ebe00240e6f5e1629f985fea6c95735cd2c401890_1_1_1_0__1",
        "ggAt2YEaCYV_text": "<p>Yes, we offer maintenance plans, updates, and long-term support to keep your website running smoothly after launch.</p>",
        "ggBLBQGHr3w_text": "<p>Absolutely. Every site we build is 100% responsive and optimized for speed, SEO, and user experience across all devices.</p>",
        "ggL6L2g80OM_childItem_0": "<p><strong>How long will it take to develop my website?</strong></p>",
        "ggL6L2g80OM_childItem_1": "<p>Do you offer Shopify, WordPress, or custom development?</p>",
        "ggL6L2g80OM_childItem_2": "<p>Will my website be mobile-friendly and SEO-optimized?</p>",
        "ggL6L2g80OM_childItem_3": "<p>What is the cost of a new website?</p>",
        "ggL6L2g80OM_childItem_4": "<p>Do you provide ongoing support or updates?</p>",
        "ggOqDmzMR4h_text": "<p>Have questions?<br>We have answers!</p>",
        "ggh2wPUXBxR_text": "<p>Costs depend on features, design complexity, and platform. We offer competitive pricing starting from $50 or $10000. Get a free quote now!</p>",
        "ggoa9d9F4z6_label": "<p>Get Started&nbsp;</p>",
        "ggpq4RKXkea_text": "<p>Timelines vary based on complexity, but most websites are delivered within 30 business days. Urgent deliveries starting in 7-10 days are also available.</p>",
        "ggzU01s7zKW_text": "<p>Yes, we specialize in Shopify, WordPress, Webflow, and fully custom-built websites using modern frameworks like React and Laravel.</p>"
      },
      "type": "gp-section-573958366498390809"
    },
